{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bc0cfcfadb8626888442f8722b407c6e562e87b390d0b778295062d7a9da295f", "ja": "（今日は可奈とやよいが出演する大人向けバラエティ\n番組の収録。撮影は順調に進み、休憩に入ったが……）", "zh": "（今天是可奈和弥生出演面向成年人的综艺节目的录制。拍摄进展顺利，进入了休息时间，但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "7e48159ed6e980fdbe0013f20256f9fed81151ab163c8dfcc7d64703fb1c4f47", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nど、どうしましょう……どうしましょう～！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n该、该怎么办……怎么办才好呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "4920560c02a043665aaed1e735bc6d5673a5b0e97d8880f67b58ad6fda180e24", "ja": "{$P$}……！\nた、大変なことを聞いちゃいましたー！", "zh": "{$P$}……！\n我、我好像听到了不得了的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1003_p", "source_sha256": "646636de2aa0d9e701c8675d645d844c8cfbe5b2f835df538d2876cac4bd34e7", "ja": "可奈とやよい……？　とりあえず、落ち着いてくれ！\nそんなに慌ててどうしたんだ？", "zh": "可奈和弥生……？总之，你先冷静一下！\n慌慌张张的到底怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "58d8f7daab8f7dd07dcb3b14f53f6319cd230133184d5025c29312353d1759f3", "ja": "ううっ、それが……番組のクライマックスで\n爆発シーンを撮るらしくて……！", "zh": "呜呜，事情是这样的……节目的高潮部分\n好像要拍爆炸戏……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "153bd2ea3b4f6b637c81549c7ec9542468b687c394e23252108e2ddc3a46a8a3", "ja": "私たち、いたずら妖精が会社や学校を爆発するって。\n……そんなこと、本当にしちゃっていいんでしょうか？", "zh": "说是我们这些恶作剧小精灵要把公司和学校炸掉……\n……这种事，真的可以做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1006_p", "source_sha256": "683480ab60a206deed8856264d253af6795f171f5adba97c1af2bfc2d5cdc5ca", "ja": "ああ、そのことなら……。", "zh": "啊，关于那件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "094786789576c80d308945c08ad889a6081eeba660a2dfd3b802a83d49c37412", "ja": "きっと、大きなニュースになりますよね！？\n私たち……爆発を仕組んだ犯人になっちゃうかも……！", "zh": "一定会成为重大新闻吧！？\n我们……说不定会变成策划爆炸的犯人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "53ad69650d48b665311ffd9ebb7c5c32c74910d1ac351c1dd666d75fae0bc0c7", "ja": "はわっ！　犯人！？　あ、もしかして私たち……\nアイドルを辞めないといけなくなったりして……？", "zh": "呀！犯人！？啊，难道我们……  \n会变得不得不放弃偶像身份吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "aea02e78912eccfd26c7644edba84df4aff893849f1858696e573ce8fb377d39", "ja": "そんなの困りますー！　まだまだアイドルやりたいし、\n可奈ちゃんとも、みんなとも一緒にいたいですー！", "zh": "那样的话我可要困扰了——！我还想继续当偶像，\n也想和可奈，还有大家一直在一起——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1010_p", "source_sha256": "035d81dfad3adcd3ca79239671283b26f0860d9ed7b36ee4dc948efc74120c9d", "ja": "待て待て、ふたりとも！　爆発シーンはCGで処理する\nから、実際に建物を壊すわけじゃないんだ。", "zh": "等等，你们两个！爆炸场面会用CG处理，\n所以并不是真的要炸毁建筑物啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "d7308d4aee2f4210f53a3448d8da76690410da1f9c41341a8ce0471d1687d58e", "ja": "ええっ！？　そうなんですか～！？\nじゃあ私たち、まだアイドル続けられますか？", "zh": "诶！？原来是这样吗～！？\n那我们还能继续当偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0a1498ff841c295c988e7f4956540739376cdfc057f5524d6f784e1378e6fdf3", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！", "zh": "好，当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "794b0306baadcba49637988f2d12b4e6c979e9a58a1d5d3f381e6c7a66d7dc11", "ja": "よかった～。スタッフさんが真剣に話してたから、\n本当に爆発させるのかと思っちゃいました！", "zh": "太好了～。因为工作人员讨论得那么认真，\n我还以为真的要引爆呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8a15a185d714d767d8ecffc1e4a3d7d32b19faa64a6345961d979597db1f24b1", "ja": "そうだったのか。ストレス発散のために考えたシーン\nらしいけど、それだけ気合いが入ってたのかもな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。听说那是为了发泄压力而设计的场景，\n不过，看来他们也确实为此投入了不少干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "a3709916b500c097cfb28fe861b0768c8c389d6de8ef32ab39fc86ef58564675", "ja": "ストレス発散……？　私は、会社や学校が爆発したら、\nとっても困りますけど……大人は違うんですか？", "zh": "释放压力……？可要是公司或学校爆炸了，我会非常困扰的……大人也不一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "9041d34cf828ad91b8a386af33a2a33c621ab16d482599488d042e745ae1ca14", "ja": "私もです！　学校がなくなっちゃったら、友達に\n会えないし……事務所や劇場がなくなったら……。", "zh": "我也是！要是学校没了，就见不到朋友了……要是事务所和剧场也没了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1017_p", "source_sha256": "89113e1da7998819f0030404e023ccabf0a0d5ad2bcd0625e7ab39d06d1d1dd7", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。でも、大人がみんな、\n会社や学校が好きとは限らないんだ。", "zh": "啊，是啊。不过，也不是所有大人都喜欢公司或学校。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1018_p", "source_sha256": "66cc7736a6912c2b854a8b8db545853de01d886e5d432f736a37ad52f9ddcb1f", "ja": "だから爆発シーンを見て、少しでもスカッとする……\n疲れた心を元気にしてもらうのが目的なんだ。", "zh": "所以才是想通过看爆炸场面，哪怕稍微痛快一下……让疲惫的心重新振作起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "66278d07935bcc8aafbe41c34f6d2c30d81add6250a4962f8145ae845735977d", "ja": "そうなんですね。爆発で元気に……それじゃあ\n私たちも、思いきりはっちゃけた方がいいかも！", "zh": "原来是这样。用爆炸让大家打起精神……那我们也该尽情闹一场才好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "11c57d7800424df07c4efc8f884391a467095f046ee00a609305e44222329ea6", "ja": "だっていたずら妖精だし、私たちが遠慮しないほうが\nきっと、見てる人たちを元気にできるよね！", "zh": "因为我们可是恶作剧精灵嘛，我们还是别客气了，\n这样一定能让观看的人们打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "19685e98315646f4a522eadd46f00931b2da23b50b9c778d08420869ac27daca", "ja": "そうだね！　大人の人たちの疲れやストレスを\n私たちがババーンって吹き飛ばしちゃおう！", "zh": "对呀！让我们把大人们的疲劳和压力，砰的一下全都吹飞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "8e77e3f221defed13ba734bfefb9b8a4a10526fabe0c21c88b3a87dc556aa407", "ja": "よーし、私も全力ではっちゃけるぞ～！\n楽しく爆発～、元気にはつらつ～♪　……えへっ♪", "zh": "好～，我也要全力嗨起来啦～！\n开开心心大爆炸～，活力满满朝气足～♪　……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0404_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e93883a6789253035110d3347076794a4606b1b54542d85c44bc5e26b9c638f8", "ja": "（可奈とやよいの元気さで、気分爽快な爆発シーンが\n撮れるだろう。……今から本番が楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（有了可奈和弥生的活力，应该能拍出让人心情舒畅的爆炸场面吧。……现在就开始期待正式拍摄了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
